  "body": "With their next home already purchased, the owners are committed to moving forward and are eager to see this much-loved property passed on to its next owners. This creates a genuinely affordable opportunity for buyers to secure a home in a central coastal location.\r\n\r\n• Open-plan living and dining area\r\n• Amazing, elevated views over Stanmore Bay\r\n• Central location between New World/Penlink Connection and the Leisure Centre/Beach\r\n• Large garage\r\n• Plenty of storage\r\n• Separate laundry/pantry\r\n• Three bedrooms, one bath, and a separate toilet\r\n\r\nA genuine opportunity for buyers to secure an elevated, sunny and warm home in a central Stanmore Bay location. While it is move-in ready, there is also an opportunity to add value over time.\r\n\r\nConjunctionals welcome.",
